Fri Aug 21 19:35:24 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 5.0.1:
  * Fix Python 3.14 pickle support (Pickler._batch_setitems)
  * Add python-httpx as a required dependency
  * Raise floors: pyarrow >= 21.0.0, huggingface-hub >= 0.25.0
  * Audio/video decoding now uses optional torchcodec
    instead of soundfile/decord
  * Drop dataset loading scripts
  * Fix symlink-following arbitrary file write during
    archive extraction and path traversal via metadata
    file_name in folder-based builders
  * Rewrite Requires/Suggests from upstream metadata
    (drop duplicated extras and stale pins)
  * Add Requires(post/postun) update-alternatives for
    datasets-cli
  * Restrict %check to tests shipped in the PyPI sdist and
    add a Dataset.map/pickle smoke test

